-- Demo data: 3 users (one per role), 4 characteristics, 12 real products with their Open Food Facts barcodes,
-- their characteristic values and some stock movements. Product data comes from Open Food Facts (ODbL),
-- see docs/domain/open-data.md. Ids are fixed so every device (and the saved session, which names the
-- signed-in user by id) sees the same rows.
-- Seeded rows are shipped with the app, so they are not written to SyncQueue.





